        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He sets the grey book gently in your pack himself.* Carry it well, and carry it close. Lore keeps faith with the mind that never set it down -- come back at fifteen and we shall see it made into something to carry in the hand."
          }
        }
      },
      {
