        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The staff is bound and finished: tall grey ash, its head wound with quiet lore.* There -- the Staff of the Grey Study. No colour set upon it yet; White, Brown, the Many Colours -- those are for a far greater day, when your power comes into its full. You have walked the first of the wizard's road. Keep to the Art, my friend."
          }
        }
